		Text: Markdown
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Headings and paragraphs
		Paragraph: A `Markdown` holds its content in a `Content` block. Each `#` heading becomes a `Heading` of that level and each paragraph a `Paragraph`, styled by the same `For element` rules. Its headings count in the levels of the document, so after this `Heading 1` it starts with `##`. A backslash at the end of a line breaks it.
			Style: intro
		Markdown:
			Content >>
				## Delivery

				The pieces are delivered within two weeks of the order, at the address
				given in the order form. Lines broken inside a paragraph join with a space.

				### Assembly

				Chairs and stools arrive assembled. Tables arrive with the legs apart
				and a key to fix them.

				Taller Nogal\
